  "description": "The Tri-1 is a marriage of our classic three-wheeled design with the very best modern componentry. The ‘fixed gear’ model is designed for simple, worry-free riding. Its short 150mm cranks provide a more natural pedalling action for shorter riders or those with restricted leg movement. The chrome riser handlebars put you in an upright position for the best visibility and comfort and a fully-enclosed chaincase protects you from the moving chain. In addition, it comes with the benefit of a secure parking brake and a powerful, low-maintenance enclosed hub brake. There is also the handy folding frame model for easy transportation and storage.\nLearn more about the Tri-1 on our main website: pashley.co.uk",
